<title>INDIA: India's NIIT 96/97 6-mo net rises.</title>
<headline>India's NIIT 96/97 6-mo net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		(in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     108.2 vs  71.0</p>
<p>    Turnover	     1,402.5 vs 935.8</p>
<p>    Gross profit	   190.1 vs 120.8</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said in a statement that it expects gross sales to reach four billion rupees during the full year ending on September 30, 1997. It gave no comparative figure.</p>
<p>--  New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
